      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DR EVIL (2) shouldered the big weight and never on the track with a plugging seventh over 1600m at Kembla Grange. Was warming up late on that occasion and ready for the 2000m. Improver. BINKOU (7) registered a strong win at this track two runs ago at the big odds. Decent effort last time out when he came from last on the turn to flash late down the outside and run second over 1800m at this track. Placed at the trip and sure to be thereabouts with the right run. LASPIRIT DEELER (3) has raced out of her grade for most of the prep and this shapes as a suitable race today. Circled the field from back in the pack with a battling eighth over 2400m at Randwick in BM78 class. No shock to see her find some form at the each-way price. FAY'S ANGELS (1) tough old mare who placed two back at Coffs Harbour in the Ken Howard Cup over 2000m. Sat outside the leader and dropped out sharply on the turn when sixth over 1900m at Canterbury in BM72 class. Not as much pressure today and can rebound quickly.",
